        "rationale": "R11: port only the claude#617 half of the adapter delta \u2014 `doctor` and `repair --strip-unknown` subparsers plus the exit-code seam (0 valid, 3 tolerated-unknowns, 4 corrupt, unmapped-status fails closed to corrupt). The adapter does no parsing of its own (authority = fleet_commons_shim.load('lease_broker')), so it cannot drift on schema; its only #54-relevant gap was the operator CLI surface. Codex-adapt: _declared_isolation and the two isolation= kwargs (claude#616, excluded per R9) and record_parent_completed's spawn_failed kwarg (excluded per R10) are deliberately not carried.",
